.TH WAVE-UNINSTALL 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-uninstall \- Uninstall a package version. The unversioned link falls back to the highest remaining version, and goes away with the last one.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave uninstall <package>[@<version>] [flags]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Uninstall a package version. The unversioned link falls back to the
highest remaining version, and goes away with the last one.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-unlink
Cancel the unversioned link for this package

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave uninstall jq
wave uninstall ffmpeg@6.1
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
